    <string name="settings_fatsecret_help_step_1">1. Go to platform.fatsecret.com and sign up for a free developer account.</string>
    <string name="settings_fatsecret_help_step_2">2. Under Basic API tab, create a new application.</string>
    <string name="settings_fatsecret_help_step_3">3. Paste your Client ID (Consumer Key) and Client Secret below.</string>
    <string name="settings_fatsecret_help_step_4">4. Tap \'Connect with OAuth\' to complete authorization.</string>
